WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.056 --> 00:00:15.542
Zoom! shot toward the bus.

2
00:00:15.562 --> 00:00:17.803
"It's Rocket Girl!"

3
00:00:18.023 --> 00:00:18.583
cried Jack.

4
00:00:18.603 --> 00:00:21.744
"I can't believe Roxy is missing this!"

5
00:00:22.104 --> 00:00:22.705
said Terrell.

6
00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:25.166
"Hang on, everyone!"

7
00:00:25.446 --> 00:00:27.206
Roxy called to the scared passengers.

8
00:00:28.187 --> 00:00:30.428
Gripping the bus, Roxy flew up into the air.

9
00:00:31.692 --> 00:00:33.513
The Ultra Car zoomed by below her.

10
00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.275
"Whew!" said Roxy.

11
00:00:37.335 --> 00:00:38.496
Everyone on the bus cheered.

12
00:00:40.297 --> 00:00:42.298
Roxy carried the bus to its next stop.

13
00:00:42.979 --> 00:00:43.679
She set it down.

14
00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:46.701
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

15
00:00:46.941 --> 00:00:47.741
said the bus driver.

16
00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:49.583
"You're welcome!"

17
00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:50.503
called Roxy.

18
00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:52.444
She flew into the air again.

19
00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:55.906
"I have to stop the Ultra Car," she thought.

20
00:00:55.926 --> 00:00:58.107
"Ruby can't control it!"

21
00:01:00.284 --> 00:01:03.946
Suddenly—whoosh! The Ultra Car flew past Roxy.

22
00:01:05.726 --> 00:01:06.847
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy.

23
00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:09.568
"I forgot that car could fly!"

24
00:01:10.368 --> 00:01:12.149
Roxy flew after the flying car.

25
00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:14.590
Ruby screamed.

26
00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.511
"Save me, Rocket Girl!"

27
00:01:17.672 --> 00:01:19.673
Ruby pressed buttons and flipped switches.

28
00:01:20.693 --> 00:01:21.934
But the car kept going.

29
00:01:22.694 --> 00:01:23.814
Zap! Zap!

30
00:01:24.275 --> 00:01:25.215
Lasers fired.

31
00:01:26.475 --> 00:01:27.336
Roxy dodged them.

32
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.381
The Ultra Car dived down.

33
00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:34.102
Splash! It plunged into the river.

34
00:01:34.983 --> 00:01:36.563
Then the car popped out of the water.

35
00:01:37.744 --> 00:01:38.784
Now it was a boat!

36
00:01:39.785 --> 00:01:41.245
It glided fast over the water.

37
00:01:42.346 --> 00:01:43.626
Roxy flew fast too.

38
00:01:45.187 --> 00:01:46.347
She grabbed the car's roof.

39
00:01:48.008 --> 00:01:50.249
Roxy used her super strength to pull off the roof.

40
00:01:50.929 --> 00:01:53.250
Rip! "Yay!"

41
00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:54.191
shouted Ruby.

42
00:01:55.031 --> 00:01:56.792
Roxy pulled Ruby from the stolen car.

43
00:01:57.692 --> 00:01:59.413
Next Roxy used her heat vision.

44
00:02:01.015 --> 00:02:03.196
Orange beams melted the car's control panel.

45
00:02:04.317 --> 00:02:06.859
The Ultra Car slowed down and then bobbed in the water.

46
00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:08.920
Ruby grinned.

47
00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.882
"Thank you, Rocket Girl."

48
00:02:11.902 --> 00:02:12.723
Roxy frowned.

49
00:02:12.743 --> 00:02:15.085
"You caused a lot of damage, Ruby."

50
00:02:15.105 --> 00:02:16.646
"Did I?"

51
00:02:17.727 --> 00:02:18.707
Ruby glanced around.

52
00:02:18.727 --> 00:02:21.389
"Oh well.

53
00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.772
Mother will pay someone to fix everything."

54
00:02:27.144 --> 00:02:28.945
Roxy picked up the car with one hand.

55
00:02:29.645 --> 00:02:30.966
She carried Ruby with the other.

56
00:02:32.066 --> 00:02:33.467
She flew back to the car show.

57
00:02:37.008 --> 00:02:38.789
"Hello, Mother," said Ruby.

58
00:02:38.809 --> 00:02:41.330
"Your favorite daughter is safe.

59
00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.151
Rocket Girl was kind enough to save me."

60
00:02:46.252 --> 00:02:48.753
Mrs. Cash dabbed her eyes with the handkerchief again.

61
00:02:48.773 --> 00:02:51.854
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!

62
00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:54.795
Thank you for saving my daughter!"

63
00:02:58.876 --> 00:03:00.877
Later Roxy and her friends were at Mara's house.

64
00:03:01.997 --> 00:03:03.157
They were playing video games.

65
00:03:03.177 --> 00:03:08.079
"You missed all the fun today, Roxy," said Jack.

66
00:03:08.099 --> 00:03:10.799
"We flew through the air in a bus!"

67
00:03:11.139 --> 00:03:11.720
said Mara.

68
00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.500
Roxy pretended to be surprised.

69
00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:17.081
"Wow! How did that happen?"

70
00:03:17.921 --> 00:03:18.622
Terrell grinned.

71
00:03:18.962 --> 00:03:21.242
"Rocket Girl carried the bus through the air.

72
00:03:22.243 --> 00:03:23.983
I told you she could help us fly!"

73
00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:27.104
"It was awesome!"

74
00:03:28.104 --> 00:03:30.065
Jack threw up his hands and dropped his controller.

75
00:03:31.346 --> 00:03:33.348
"Oops!" Everyone laughed.

76
00:03:35.589 --> 00:03:38.491
"Good thing Rocket Girl didn't drop your bus!"

77
00:03:38.771 --> 00:03:39.392
said Roxy.
